    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BEES\nIRAQI AIRWAYS\nIRAOI AIRMAES\nWinter Timetable\nFares\nEffective Ist November, 1950.\nIraqi State Railways",
      "IRAQI AIRWAYS\nWINTER\nTIMETABLES\nTwice Weekly\nMon.\nWed.\n08.00\n09.30\nViking Aircraft\ndep. BAGHDAD\narr. BASRAH\narr.\n18.55\ndep.\n17.15\n(Effective 1st November, 1950)\n10.15\ndep. BASRAH\nart.\n16.25\n10.55\narr. KUWAIT\nBAGHDAD-DAMASCUS-CAIRO\ndep.\n15.45\n11.15\ndep. KUWAIT\narr.\n15.25\nOnee Weekly\nViking Aireraft\n13.45\narr. BAHREIN\ndep.\n14.45\nMon.\nWed.\n07.30\ndep.\nBAGHDAD\narr.\n19.55\nTues.\n09.10\narr.\nDAMASCUS\ndep.\n16.30\n09.50\ndep. DAMASCUS\narr.\n15.50\nTues.\nFARES AND RATES\n12.20\narr. CAIRO\ndep.\n13.30\nBAGHDAD-DAMASCUS-BEIRUT\nTwice Weekly\nViking or Dové Aireraft\nSun.\nViking.\n08-30\n10-10\n11-00\n11-40\nThur.\nDove.\n08-30\nThur.\nDove.\n16-45\n10-45\ndep.\nBAGHDAD\narr.\nDAMASCUC\ndep. DAMASCUS\narr.\nBEIRUT\nBAGHDAD-TEHRAN\nOnce Weekly\nMon.\n10.00\n12.45\ndep. BAGHDAD\narr.\nTEHRAN\narr.\ndep.\narr.\ndep.\narr.\ndep.\n12-45\nSun.\nViking.\n17-35\n14-10\n13-20\n12-45\nViking Aireraft\n16.25\n14.30\nMon.\nBAGHDAD-BASRAH-KUWAIT\nFive Times Weekly\nViking or Dove Aircraft\nSun.\nTues.\nThur.\nFri.\nSat.\n08.00\n09.30\n10.30\n11.10\ndep. BAGHDAD\nart. BASRAH\ndep. BASRAH\narr. KUWAIT\nart.\ndep.\narr.\ndep.\n15.55\n14.15\n12.25\n11.45\nSun.\nTues.\nThur.\nFri.\nSat.\n\u003c\nBAGHDAD-BASRAH--KUWAIT-BAHREIN\nFrom\nBaghdad\nto: —\nBasrah\nKuwait\nBahrein\nTehran\nCairo\nDamascus\nBeirut\nBasrah to:-\nKuwait\nBabrein\nKuwait to:-\nBahrein\nDamascus to:-\nCairo\nTehran\nCairo to:-\nBasrah\nKuwait\nBahrein\nTehran\nSingle\nFare\nI.D.\nReturn\nFare\nI.D.\nExcess\nBaggage\nper kg.\nFils\nAir\nCargo\nper kg.\nFils\n8-000\n11-500\n21-000\n19-000\n29-950\n18-700\n19-800\n14-400\n20-700\n37-800\n34-200\n53-950\n33-700\n35-650\n80\n115\n210\n190\n300\n190\n200\n65\n75\n130\n100\n225\n130\n130\n3-500\n13-000\n6-300\n23-400\n35\n130\n25\n75\n11-000\n19-800\n110\n60\n13-500\n35-000\n24-300\n63-000\n135\n350\n105\n230\n37-000\n39-000\n44.000\n45-000\n66-600\n70-200\n79-200\n81-000\n370\n390\n440\n450\n225\n225\n240\n325\nALL TIMES SHOWN 